"text": "Every gate is one entry of the fence below, in the order /implement runs it. - No `leg = 'live'` entry: no external process is driven. - The windowed smoke needs `WAYLAND_DISPLAY`; unset, it reads `not run`, and the windowed build stays proven by its `build` entry and CI. The smoke cannot see a focus ring or a `:focus-within` style. The windowed half of the redraw change is witnessed by upstream's `focus_redraw.rs` on its counting shell alone. That limit is recorded, not claimed. - The coverage leg is not run locally: the take changes no line of the three floored crates (escher-driver, dioxus-native-dom, blitz-test-harness). Its `coverage floor: 3 of 3` reading is CI's \"Coverage report\" job, which the CI read's green covers, `keyboard_compat.rs` still excluded by the leg's own words (CARRY 2 entry). - The CI-reading acceptance spans two runs by construction, so the operator's commit and push precede the CI read. - Every git read of what this chunk changed names the base `67f17b9d632ceb66f6c01b347d9f9ba036dd29b6`."
